                                "sense_id": "ed622f91-294b-3d3c-b377-a5ba18585808",
                                "text": "A platter of chicken and octopus tostadas and two ceviches arrived at the table[…]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e4550204-dbb3-3389-b132-4baced4b256a",
